# 📊 Smart Financial Management & Stock Prediction System

An AI-powered personal finance management platform built with Django and Machine Learning to help users track income, manage expenses, analyze bills, visualize financial trends, and predict stock prices using predictive analytics.

---

 🚀 Key Features

 👤 User Management
- Secure user registration & login system
- Admin approval/rejection workflow
- User account management dashboard

 💰 Financial Tracking
- Fixed Income Management
- Other Income Tracking
- Fixed Expense Tracking
- Other Expense Monitoring
- Update / Delete financial records

 📈 Financial Analytics Dashboard
- Monthly & Annual income analysis
- Expense calculations
- Net savings tracking
- Automated tax estimation
- Financial summary reports

 📊 Data Visualization
- Monthly income vs expense trend graphs
- Dynamic chart generation using Matplotlib
- Financial performance insights

 🧾 Smart Bill Scanner (OCR)
- Upload bill receipts
- Extract invoice details using Tesseract OCR
- Parse:
  - Invoice Number
  - Date
  - Items Purchased
  - Quantity & Price
  - Total Amount

 🤖 Stock Price Prediction (AI)
Machine Learning based stock forecasting using:

- Artificial Neural Network (Keras)
- Support Vector Regression (SVR)
- Linear Regression
- Decision Tree Regression

Predicts future stock prices using historical market data from Alpha Vantage API.

 ☁️ Sentiment & Text Analysis
- Text sentiment analysis using TextBlob
- WordCloud generation for review insights
- Data-driven visualization reports

